{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118457","id":4246516639,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HLOf","number":118457,"title":"Null pointer dereference on freed reflection probes in LightStorage","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:27:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:12Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/light_storage.cpp`, `reflection_probe_owner.get_or_null()` is called but the result is dereferenced without a null check in two places:\n\n**Line 1764-1765:**\n```cpp\nReflectionProbe *probe = reflection_probe_owner.get_or_null(rpi->probe);\nVector3 extents = probe->size / 2;  // CRASH if probe is null\n```\n\n**Line 1788-1792:**\n```cpp\nReflectionProbe *probe = reflection_probe_owner.get_or_null(rpi->probe);\n// ...\nVector3 extents = probe->size / 2;  // CRASH if probe is null\n```\n\nIf a reflection probe is freed while its instance still exists in the render list (e.g., due to frame scheduling or deferred deletion), dereferencing the null pointer crashes the engine. The `rpi` is null-checked (line 1761), but `probe` is not.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a reflection probe in a scene.\n2. Free the probe while the renderer is processing reflection instances.\n3. Crash in release builds.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — null pointer dereference pattern visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118457/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}